# Oxidized device list. One device per line, ":" separated:
#   name:ip:model:username:password:enable
# - name     node name; also the file name in the git repo
# - ip       management IP (resolve_dns is false, so this is required)
# - model    oxidized model: ios, iosxe, nxos, junos, routeros, fortios, eos, ...
#            full list: https://github.com/ytti/oxidized/blob/master/docs/Supported-OS-Types.md
# - enable   enable secret; leave empty if not needed (keep the trailing ":")
# Passwords must not contain ":". IPv6 addresses don't work with this
# delimiter; use a DNS name instead and set resolve_dns: true.
core-sw01:10.0.0.1:ios:oxidized:change-me-password:change-me-enable
edge-rt01:10.0.0.2:junos:oxidized:change-me-password:
